133
# Allowed `tsc -b --noEmit` error count. Enforced by typecheck_frontend in
# scripts/_common.sh: the deploy fails above this number.
#
# Not a target to live with. Until 2026-08-08 the deploy gate ran bare `tsc
# --noEmit` against a solution-style tsconfig, which follows no references and
# so typechecked nothing at all. 199 accumulated behind that; this number is
# what is left. It exists only so turning the gate on does not block every
# deploy at once.
#
# Lower it in the same commit that fixes errors. The helper prints the real
# count and tells you when this can come down; it deliberately never edits this
# file itself, because a self-lowering baseline hides the progress it measures.
#
# Cleanup plan: .claude/handoffs/2026-08-08-nasun-website-tsc-gate.md
